OL,4,G1800FThe Craig Charles Funk and Soul
OL,5,     FShow
OL,6,     GPutting down the Trunk of Funk
OL,7,     Gthis week is Miles Away Records.
OL,8,     GA label known for unearthing deep
OL,9,     Gsoul, rare grooves and
OL,10,     Gbeautifully restored sounds from
OL,11,     Gthe past.
OL,12,G2100FDon Letts' Culture Clash Radio
OL,13,     GDon's Saturday night selections
OL,14,     Gcross time, space and genre. This
OL,15,     Gweek, he's got new numbers by
OL,16,     GAlan Braxe & Fred Falke, Fauna,
OL,17,     GThe Flying Hats and BCUC.
OL,18,G2300FSHERELLE
OL,19,     GSHERELLE leans into the darker
OL,20,     Gside of jungle, techno and
OL,21,     Ghardcore to see out January.
